{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00506","headline":"郊庙歌辞 祀风师乐章 送神 · 包佶","name":"郊庙歌辞 祀风师乐章 送神","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"微穆敷华能应节，飘扬发彩宜行庆。\n送迎灵驾神心享，跪拜灵坛礼容盛。\n气和草木发萌芽，德畅禽鱼遂翔泳。\n永望翠盖逐流云，自兹率土调春令。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包佶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00506.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00506","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}